.env*.local
# `.env*.local` only matches names *ending* in `.local`, so a hand-made backup
# -- `.env.local.bak`, `.env.local.2026-09-01` -- was not ignored and sat in a
# public repo's working tree holding every secret the real file holds. This
# line covers anything prefixed by the real file's name.
.env.local*
node_modules
.next
next-env.d.ts
*.tsbuildinfo

# Playwright
test-results
playwright-report
.playwright

# Raw Helius payloads: they carry real addresses and real signatures, and the
# signature is in the filename. Spec §8.3 keeps those out of the tree.
fixtures/helius

# Vercel CLI: the linked project's ids (this repo is public), and the .env it
# pulls down.
.vercel
.env

# Scratch de sesión: el arranque local contra la rama preview de Neon.
# Se coló al tracking el 2026-09-04 en un commit de otra sesión (ver CLAUDE.md,
# "One session per working tree"), que barrió el árbol de trabajo entero.
.dev.sh
